#. y1:english="Hey, {PA:10}are you alone?{PA:20}||You got a minute?\nYeah.\nI work in a hostess bar near here.\nThe date I promised with a customer was||cancelled.\nI don't know what to do...{PA:20}\nWon't you come to the bar with me,||if you don't mind?\nNo,{PA:10} I'm busy.\nOh,{PA:10} really?{PA:10}||Well, forget it then.\nOkay,{PA:10} I'll go.\nReally! {PA:10}Wonderful!!{MR:00}\nOh,{PA:10} it's too early to come into work,||why don't we go on a date?\nSorry,{PA:10} but I don't have time for a date.\nHuh?{PA:10} Fine then!{PA:10}||You can take off!\nSee you later!\nNo,{PA:10} I'm busy.\nLoosen up,{PA:10}||let's have some fun!\nIf you got snubbed by someone,{PA:10} you should||just go home.{PA:20} Don't sweat other men.\nWhat?!{PA:10} How rude!{PA:10}||I wasn't snubbed!\nScrew you!{PA:10} Get lost!"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0049.BIN:77_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0049.BIN::line:77_0_0"
msgid "Oye, {PA:10}¿estás solo?{PA:20}||¿Tienes un minuto?"
msgstr ""

