#. y1:english="Aniki, {PA:10}this way!\nWhat the hell is this?\nWell... {PA:10}I told you there's a girl||who is madly in love with me, right?\nYeah.\nEverything was going so well, too well...{PA:20}||Turns out she's some other Yakuza's whore!\nIt ended up being a con.{PA:20}||So, {PA:10}what do you want me to do about it?\nThe Yakuza who is backing her called me up.\nIf I go alone... {PA:10}he'll bleed me dry then||toss me into Tokyo Bay with concrete shoes.\nGive me a break.{PA:20}||Take care of this bullshit yourself.\nAniki!{PA:10}||Please!\nWhere is the Yakuza?\nHe's just around the corner..."
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0049.BIN:92_0_5
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0049.BIN::line:92_0_5"
msgid "Acabó siendo un timo.{PA:20}||Así que,{PA:10} ¿qué quieres que haga al respecto?"
msgstr ""

