#. y1:english="Hey, {PA:10}Kano!||I told you to come alone.\nWhat the fuck are you thinking,||fucking with my girl...?\nYou better apologize like you mean it!\nYou're a shitty actor!{PA:20}||This has been a setup all along, hasn't it?\nWhat? {PA:20}You better watch what you say to me!\nI'm the one who wants to talk it out.\nBut if you prefer a different way||to settle this shit, bring it on!\nUgh...!\nListen, {PA:10}Kano-san. {PA:20}4,000,000 yen||for all the troubles you caused.\nYou proposed this yourself now...\nI can't afford 4,000,000 yen!{PA:20}||Aniki, {PA:10}say something to him!\nIt's none of my business. {PA:10}See you.\nAniki, I'm in deep shit!\nPlease, Aniki!{PA:10}||Say something to him!\nIt's none of my business. {PA:10}See you.\nHehe. {PA:20}He is very understanding.\nAniki...{PA:10}||I thought we were in this together...\nI like you, Dragon of the Dojima Family.{PA:20}||Listen.\nThere's the noodle shop in this city.\nAsk the owner for||a \"Half Order, Extra Soup\".\nThey'll let you in to an underground casino||first-timers are rejected.\nKeep this to yourself though.\n...Well, {PA:10}I gotta talk to Kano-san||for a little bit longer.{PA:20}\nIt's best if you get lost now.\n\nWhy don't you let it slide this time?||{PA:10}He's still young.\nYeah, he is. He's a fucking idiot,{PA:20}||walked right into a trap...\nI'm gonna warn you,{PA:20}||we're known to not show any mercy.\n"
#: MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0049.BIN:93_0_0
msgctxt "MEDIA/STGTALK/SPA/ST_KAB0049.BIN::line:93_0_0"
msgid "iHey,{PA:10} Kano!{PA:20}||Te dije que vinieras solo."
msgstr ""

